sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant Edge as Edge / CDN
    participant API as API service
    participant Auth as Auth and quota
    participant Rt as Model router
    participant Inf as Inference server
    participant GPU as GPU
    B->>Edge: POST the message, expects a stream
    Edge->>API: terminate TLS, forward
    API->>Auth: who is this, and do they have budget?
    Auth-->>API: allowed
    API->>Rt: which model, which region?
    Rt->>Inf: a replica with free KV cache
    Inf->>GPU: prefill
    GPU-->>Inf: first token
    Inf-->>B: stream begins — TTFT stops here
    loop remaining tokens
        GPU-->>Inf: token
        Inf-->>B: forward it down the open connection
    end
    Note over B,Edge: the response is a stream, so it cannot be cached like a normal GET
